Z||000011||72vinman||09-07-2001||05:20 PM||||That's exactly what was happening to my passenger side. I ordered Rodney's rebuild kit and recieved it in a couple of day's. The instructions he sends are pretty detailed. It took me about an hour to do and it works fantastics. Now the only problem is it goes up and down so smooth I have to rebuild the other one to match.<BR> Thanks Rodney  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> , class act all the way. <BR>More than I can say about others on here selling stuff.<P>------------------<BR>72vinman@home.com<BR>Stock Black 86GT<BR> <A HREF="http://www.members.home.net/gtaclub/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.members.home.net/gtaclub/</A> ||||reg||14
